				<section class="elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-1e92f53 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default" data-id="1e92f53" data-element_type="section" data-e-type="section" data-settings="{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}">
						<div class="elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default">
					<div class="elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-7899bf8" data-id="7899bf8" data-element_type="column" data-e-type="column">
			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-bde6355 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="bde6355" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h4 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">FAQ’s</h4>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-282c583 elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading" data-id="282c583" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="heading.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
					<h3 class="elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default">Answers to Some Common Questions</h3>				</div>
				</div>
				<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-879535f elementor-widget elementor-widget-accordion" data-id="879535f" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="accordion.default">
				<div class="elementor-widget-container">
							<div class="elementor-accordion">
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1421" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="1" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1421" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><i class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How do I set up a company in free zone UAE?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1421" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="1" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1421"><p>In order to set up a company in the UAE free zone, you need to follow all the standards properly. Firstly, selecting a free zone is important, following opting for a business activity. After this, giving the ideal trade name is required. Getting the license is also unavoidable.  Keep in mind that every freezone offers its own regulations that are different from the rest.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1422" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="2" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1422" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><i class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How much does it cost to register a free zone company in the UAE?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1422" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="2" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1422"><p>The registration of free zone companies in the UAE changes from time to time, influenced by the following aspects.  These may include type of business, office spacing need etc. the cost covers additional fee for visas, extra services or office space. This will add up in the total cost.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1423" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="3" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1423" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><i class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Does the UAE companies’ law apply in free zones?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1423" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="3" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1423"><p>The UAE commercial companies law has no effect on freezone. All of them come with their own set of regulations, irrespective of the government based implication on other areas of the country. These aspects offer more perks and easy operations.</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1424" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="4" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1424" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><i class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">Is Freezone exempted from corporate tax in UAE?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1424" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="4" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1424"><p><strong>Absolutely yes, free zones in the UAE are usually free from any imposed corporate tax.</strong> whereas, this duty-free facility is applicable only when following the specific conditions and requirements. These factors may include conducting qualifying activities within the free zone. For better detail and understanding,  you can access consultation from an expert of law..</p></div>
				</div>
							<div class="elementor-accordion-item">
					<div id="elementor-tab-title-1425" class="elementor-tab-title" data-tab="5" role="button" aria-controls="elementor-tab-content-1425" aria-expanded="false">
													<span class="elementor-accordion-icon elementor-accordion-icon-right" aria-hidden="true">
															<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-closed"><i class="fas fa-plus"></i></span>
								<span class="elementor-accordion-icon-opened"><i class="fas fa-minus"></i></span>
														</span>
												<a class="elementor-accordion-title" tabindex="0">How long does it take to set up and register a Dubai free zone company?</a>
					</div>
					<div id="elementor-tab-content-1425" class="elementor-tab-content elementor-clearfix" data-tab="5" role="region" aria-labelledby="elementor-tab-title-1425"><p>Setting up a Dubai free zone company usually lasts for 2-4 weeks<strong>. </strong>whereas, the time duration is influenced with the business activity, the selected free zone and also the processing of registration. .</p></div>
				</div>
								</div>
						</div>
				</div>
					</div>
		</div>
					</div>
		</section>
